    16: * is playing), and the bark audio side effect.
    17: *
    18: * Rules:
    19: * - mood "attentive" → tapping does nothing playful (no reaction at all).
    20: * - prefers-reduced-motion → rotate only through bubble and bark.
    21: * - bark → skipped if the audio file fails to load or sound is off; never throw.
    22: */
